tags: oxide helios omicron dev setup troubleshooting

! Oxide Omicron on Helios (T440 / hellhound) - Clean Single-Node Dev Setup

!! Last updated
2026-06-06

!! Status
Working external network path on `bge0` (with admin IP safety net). Fake network on `bge1` available for future testing.

!! Problem Summary
The main blocker is the RSS "time is not yet synchronized" gate + Zpool UUID mismatch from repeated failed installs. The CMOS battery was dead (causing clock resets). Fake network adds complexity but gives better control. External network on `bge0` is simpler and sufficient for dev.

!! Recommended Hardware Setup
* **bge0** → Main/management interface (static admin IP `10.42.0.21/24`)
* **bge1** → Available for fake network or future experiments
* Always SSH to the admin IP to avoid lockouts

!! Clean Setup Steps (External Network on bge0)

# Admin IP (safety net)
```bash
pfexec ipadm create-addr -T static --address 10.42.0.21/24 bge0/admin